      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Why the reader changed",
      "items": [
        "The path of a change request is a numbered list, and the site's reader refuses markdown it cannot show",
        "A list must count 1, 2, 3 or the build fails, because GitHub numbers from the first item and ignores the rest"
      ]
    },
